a":"什么是世界空间画布（Canvas）"}]},{"ID":"20251106144500-v1s6brk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144500-v1s6brk","updated":"20251106144558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所谓世界空间画布，就是将 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的 Render Mode（渲染模式）参数，设置为 World Space（世界空间）的画布"}]},{"ID":"20251106144600-mvmwvop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144600-mvmwvop","updated":"20251106144948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251106144924-h2cq2cd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251106144550-60zpx5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144550-60zpx5f","updated":"20251106144550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般在以下情况可能使用这种 UI 模式"}]},{"ID":"20251106144504-hfcv1qx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144504-hfcv1qx","updated":"20251106144539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144504-9qu4bnd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144504-9qu4bnd","updated":"20251106144504"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144504-kbhfkmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144504-kbhfkmy","updated":"20251106144509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VR / AR 项目中"}]},{"ID":"20251106144507-eauxx5r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144507-eauxx5r","updated":"20251106144532"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144532-12ne8e4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144532-12ne8e4","updated":"20251106144532"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144532-mkp674g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144532-mkp674g","updated":"20251106144532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 元素希望在 3D 世界中和场景物体混合显示"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144533-na4lxhi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144533-na4lxhi","updated":"20251106144533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144533-yegqqye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144533-yegqqye","updated":"20251106144533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VR 中常见的 悬浮菜单、手腕面板"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144534-x7nccos","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144534-x7nccos","updated":"20251106144534"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144534-cxovsfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144534-cxovsfw","updated":"20251106144534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景内的交互 UI，比如 箱子、门、机关上方的 交互提示"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144535-vcv7zpg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144535-vcv7zpg","updated":"20251106144535"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144535-x8yrpko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144535-x8yrpko","updated":"20251106144535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贴在墙上的按钮、开关 UI"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144530-7ua8zxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144530-7ua8zxp","updated":"20251106144530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144504-m7bp09o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144504-m7bp09o","updated":"20251106144539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144504-37i20lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144504-37i20lr","updated":"20251106144504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"游戏项目中"}]},{"ID":"20251106144539-2dyrzev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144539-2dyrzev","updated":"20251106144539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家或 NPC 头顶的 血条 、 名字 、 Buff 图标"}]},{"ID":"20251106144537-1kjr9rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144537-1kjr9rk","updated":"20251106144537"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144500-tb44t6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144500-tb44t6o","updated":"20251106144500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总体而言\nUI 必须是 3D 世界的一部分，而不是固定在屏幕上的 2D 界面时\n就可能会用到 世界空间画布（Canvas）"}]},{"ID":"20251106144635-icpctwk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251106144635-icpctwk","updated":"20251106144924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为世界空间画布（Canvas）显示定义摄像机"}]},{"ID":"20251106144642-07vhy9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144642-07vhy9o","updated":"20251106144924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当 Canvas 的模式是 World Space 时，如果不设置它的 Event Camera 参数，并且所有摄像机都设置的会渲染 UI 层的话\n那么 UI 元素就可能被多个摄像机渲染，从而带来性能浪费"}]},{"ID":"20251106144642-22i7oeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144642-22i7oeb","updated":"20251106144821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们的项目中经常可能存在多个摄像机，比如 主相机、小地图相机、后处理相机、预渲染摄像机 等等"}]},{"ID":"20251106144819-821kkc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144819-821kkc1","updated":"20251106144819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果这些相机没有进行专门的设置，可能都会渲染UI层\n那带来的问题就是：同一份 UI 可能会被多次渲染，从而浪费性能\n它可能带来的性能开销有："}]},{"ID":"20251106144800-rd09bnv","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144800-rd09bnv","updated":"20251106144803"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144800-yx7rk5q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144800-yx7rk5q","updated":"20251106144803"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144800-d2pl37s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144800-d2pl37s","updated":"20251106144803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU =\u003e 会重复提交 DrawCall 等"}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144801-btpi0zi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251106144801-btpi0zi","updated":"20251106144801"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251106144801-lpwffry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144801-lpwffry","updated":"20251106144801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU =\u003e 重复进行像素填充 等"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251106144642-mxebnji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251106144642-mxebnji","updated":"20251106144742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此，我们应该养成良好的习惯，为世界空间画布（Canvas）显示的定义关联摄像机，明确设置 Event Camera\n并且 让其他不需要渲染 UI 的相机在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230709202327-6wfv7kp","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Culling Mask"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (剔除遮罩) 中排除 UI 层\n这样就可以有效解决该问题，减少我们的性能浪费！"}]},{"ID":"20251106144933-hpxhvb6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251106144933-hpxhvb6","updated":"20251111111140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要使用透明度组件隐藏组件"}]},{"ID":"20251106150222-xbh5e5z","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251106150222-xbh5e5z","updated":"20251111111140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251110200249-bo7hrww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200249-bo7hrww","updated":"20251110200359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 UGUI 中，有以下几种方式可以隐藏 UI 元素"}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-0c8xprh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-0c8xprh","updated":"20251111111140"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-29rdaoz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-29rdaoz","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-r32i95f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-r32i95f","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"SetActive"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法 设置 UI 元素依附对象的激活失活状态"}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-3kbeb5a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-3kbeb5a","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"会触发 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 重建，恢复时也要重建，开销较大"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-qzksg41","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-qzksg41","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-2kj45rq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-2kj45rq","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过失活 UI 元素的 图形组件"}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-8fa06vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-8fa06vd","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该元素不渲染，但仍会导致所在 Canvas 重建"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-zgiao7w","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-zgiao7w","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-htxuje6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-htxuje6","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CanvasGroup"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 组件的整体改变透明度为 0"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-pts1mhc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-pts1mhc","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-o9nhdok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-o9nhdok","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过组件颜色 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Color"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 属性改变透明度为 0"}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-1vvkfro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-1vvkfro","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CanvasGroup"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Color"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 属性设置为透明 仍然会生成网格、送入渲染流程;\nGPU 依然在画，只是全透明"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-kgppw53","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-kgppw53","updated":"20251111111140"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200356-s8bo1ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-s8bo1ug","updated":"20251110200356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过将 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（画布）组件失活"}]},{"ID":"20251110200356-gkmk0m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200356-gkmk0m7","updated":"20251111111140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只禁用这个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的渲染器，整个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 下 UI 元素 不参与渲染和事件检测"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200249-93shs11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200249-93shs11","updated":"20251110200439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在上文通过禁用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（画布）组件来隐藏 UI 元素中，\n就强调了通过禁用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Canvas"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 组件的方式隐藏组件是相对最节约性能的方式\n这里再来强调一次不要使用透明度隐藏组件的相关内容"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200442-ya8j8io","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251110200442-ya8j8io","updated":"20251110200552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么不要使用透明度隐藏组件"}]},{"ID":"20251110200503-sumzl1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200503-sumzl1o","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原因\n透明度隐藏依旧会触发渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251110200520-nytkrdi","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-nytkrdi","updated":"20251110200545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200520-tcl3pd9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-tcl3pd9","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200520-pbcgxp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-pbcgxp0","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生成网格"}]},{"ID":"20251110200521-ofysdu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200521-ofysdu0","updated":"20251110200521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"UI 元素依然会生成顶点数据"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200520-jyh4gkq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-jyh4gkq","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200520-vp4r6ms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-vp4r6ms","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提交 DrawCall"}]},{"ID":"20251110200522-8an6jnp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200522-8an6jnp","updated":"20251110200527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CanvasRenderer"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 还是会把看似隐藏的 UI 元素打包提交给 GPU"}]}]},{"ID":"20251110200520-wkutah0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-wkutah0","updated":"20251110200520"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251110200520-12kft9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200520-12kft9x","updated":"20251110200531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 渲染"}]},{"ID":"20251110200532-x0nam58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251110200532-x0nam58","updated":"20251110200536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 照常进行光栅化、像素着色，只是最终混合结果是透明像素\n也就是说，G